monarch.description:
{stock_result}

Optionally connect Monarch Money to track account balances and detect paychecks.

This integration uses the community-maintained monarchmoneycommunity Python package (github.com/bradleyseanf/monarchmoneycommunity) to access your Monarch Money data. Your credentials are stored locally in your Home Assistant config and are only used to authenticate directly with Monarch Money. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Monarch Money.

